{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55244","headline":"冷金亭赏菊分韵赋秋鴈（题拟） · 陶敞","name":"冷金亭赏菊分韵赋秋鴈（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天扫闲云秋净时，书空匠者最相宜。\n（见《说郛》卷六一《清异录》。\n）（〖1〗《清异录》：「乾佑中冷金亭赏菊，分韵赋秋鴈，族子秘书丞敞先就，诗曰〖略〗。\n」）（按：《清异录》一书，旧题陶谷擢，然自陈振孙以来，多疑爲僞托，近人王国维《庚辛之间读书志》、余嘉锡《四库提要辨证》卷十八力证不出谷手，究爲谁作，尚难考详。\n今敞姓姑从陶姓，确否待考。\n郑方坤《五代诗话》卷二以爲韩敞，未列证，今不取。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陶敞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55244.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55244","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}